Package: bayestrace
Type: Package
Title: Reproting tool for BayesTrace
Version: 1.0.0
Author: H. Christoph Liedtke
Maintainer: H. Christoph Liedtke <christoph.liedtke@ebd.csic.es>
Description: This package generates an HTML report, in the style of a dashboard, evaluating the most important output of an analysis conducted using the software BayesTraits (https://www.evolution.reading.ac.uk/BayesTraitsV4.1.3/BayesTraitsV4.1.3.html).
